   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Thanks for the detailed report.\r<br>\r<br>Indeed, gcc 4.1 is too old.\r<br>\r<br>We&#39;ve only tested Linux with gcc versions 4.4 to 4.7.\r<br>We know Stan requires at least 4.2.\r<br>\r<br>Ben --- have you tested gcc 4.8?  That&#39;s the latest\r<br>stable version.  GNU itself only supports back\r<br>to version 4.7:\r<br>\r<br>   <a href=\"http://gcc.gnu.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://gcc.gnu.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467485546000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0AkC3nN-1xUVG6UrnNWvfM\">http://gcc.gnu.org</a>\r<br>\r<br>- Bob\r<br>\r<br>On 11/23/13, 1:53 PM, Timothï¿½e Flutre wrote:\r<br>&gt; I followed step by step the instructions &lt;<a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/rstan/wiki/RStan-Getting-Started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/rstan/wiki/RStan-Getting-Started&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467485546000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-88MvYb0Ol-7RED8a-AYn\">https://github.com/stan-dev/rstan/wiki/RStan-Getting-Started</a>&gt; but got the\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "&gt; message &quot;compilation failed&quot;:\r<br>&gt; |\r<br>&gt; install.packages(&#39;inline&#39;)\r<br>&gt; install.packages(&#39;Rcpp&#39;)\r<br>&gt; library(inline)\r<br>&gt; library(Rcpp)\r<br>&gt; src &lt;- &#39;\r<br>&gt;    std::vector&lt;std::string&gt; s;\r<br>&gt;    s.push_back(&quot;hello&quot;);\r<br>&gt;    s.push_back(&quot;world&quot;);\r<br>&gt;    return Rcpp::wrap(s);\r<br>&gt; &#39;\r<br>&gt; hellofun &lt;- cxxfunction(body = src, includes = &#39;&#39;, plugin = &#39;Rcpp&#39;, verbose = FALSE)\r<br>&gt; cat(hellofun(), &#39;\\n&#39;)\r<br>&gt; options(repos = c(getOption(&quot;repos&quot;), rstan = &quot;<a href=\"http://wiki.rstan-repo.googlecode.com/git/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://wiki.rstan-repo.googlecode.com/git/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467485546000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ETOV0U_J14f0FSqyQ8dw1\">http://wiki.rstan-repo.googlecode.com/git/</a>&quot;))\r<br>&gt; install.packages(&#39;rstan&#39;, type = &#39;source&#39;)\r<br>&gt; ...\r<br>&gt; make: *** [gm__grammars__expression_grammar_inst.o] Error 1\r<br>"
